      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I want urgent blood tests done, that's for severe drug reaction. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Let's use prednisolone, 40 milligrams, once a day, until review. That's for severe drug reaction. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up.",
